--- !u!114 &1643546553
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1643546551}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8ffd1a4c39a4c7742a34ebc5b6204daf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CeoDialogue
  dialogueText: {fileID: 2103898065}
  lines:
  - I must have surprised you, showing up like this. Then again... can a robot even
    be surprised?
  - 'My time is valuable, so I''ll get straight to the point. '
  - 'I''ve been told your work reliability data is impressive. '
  - 'You''re... different from the other robots. Let''s just say you''re special. '
  - I've heard some strange rumors. Something about becoming human.
  - Even you, a robot, must think the others are foolish for believing such rumors,
    don't you?
  - So I'll give you a new position.
  - Nothing major. Just keep an eye on the other robots.
  - If you spot any suspicious behavior, dispose of them.
  - You'll get better pay and an easier job than you have now.
  - What do you think? Tempting, isn't it?
  choicePanel: {fileID: 2083346428}
  choiceButton1: {fileID: 526939237}
  choiceButton2: {fileID: 2074716308}
  choice1Text: I accept
  choice2Text: I refuse
  lastDialogue1: You won't regret it. You're a smart robot, after all.
  lastDialogue2: What? Well, I suppose it can't be helped. Foolish thing.
  goToThisScene: {fileID: 285070609}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
